{{!
    @template mod_starrating/mobile_course_page

    @copyright  2026 Think Modular
    @license    https://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    The stars as they appear inline on the course page in the Moodle app. There
    are as many as the scale of the activity is long, two to ten.

    The app renders this through core-format-text, so no app directive works
    here and the stars are plain markup. mobile/init.js gives them their
    behaviour: one tap saves the rating and repaints the stars in place, without
    opening the activity. Without that script they are a display only, which is
    also what people who may not rate get.

    The activity name has to be printed here: the app replaces the module title
    with this content, so nothing else would show what is being rated.

    The data attributes are the contract with mobile/init.js.

    An activity that asks for text feedback adds a plain textarea, which
    mobile/init.js sends with every tap on a star, and a button that saves the
    text alone. That button is always rendered and only hidden while there is no
    rating, so the script can reveal it after the first tap without a reload.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name string Name of the activity, which is the criterion
    * cmid int Course module id
    * courseid int Course id
    * userrating int Stars the current user gave, 0 when not rated
    * canrate bool Whether the user may rate
    * stars array List of value, on and label
    * statustext string The current user rating in words
    * showaverage bool Whether to show the average
    * averagetext string The average in words
    * feedbackform bool Whether the activity asks for text feedback
    * feedback string Feedback the current user gave
    * feedbackmaxlength int Longest feedback that is stored
    * feedbacklabel string Label of the feedback field
    * savefeedbacklabel string Text of the button that saves the feedback alone

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "Teaching quality",
        "cmid": 12,
        "courseid": 7,
        "userrating": 3,
        "canrate": true,
        "stars": [
            {"value": 1, "on": true, "label": "Rate Teaching quality with 1 of 5 stars"},
            {"value": 2, "on": true, "label": "Rate Teaching quality with 2 of 5 stars"},
            {"value": 3, "on": true, "label": "Rate Teaching quality with 3 of 5 stars"},
            {"value": 4, "on": false, "label": "Rate Teaching quality with 4 of 5 stars"},
            {"value": 5, "on": false, "label": "Rate Teaching quality with 5 of 5 stars"}
        ],
        "statustext": "Your rating for Teaching quality: 3 of 5 stars",
        "showaverage": true,
        "averagetext": "Average 3.8 of 5 from 12 ratings",
        "feedbackform": true,
        "feedback": "Clear and well paced",
        "feedbackmaxlength": 255,
        "feedbacklabel": "Your feedback (optional)",
        "savefeedbacklabel": "Save feedback"
    }
}}
<div class="starrating-activity starrating-app-coursepage" data-cmid="{{cmid}}" data-courseid="{{courseid}}"
    data-userrating="{{userrating}}" data-canrate="{{#canrate}}1{{/canrate}}{{^canrate}}0{{/canrate}}">
    <span class="starrating-name">{{name}}</span>
    <span class="starrating-widget" role="group" aria-label="{{name}}">
        <span class="sr-only visually-hidden" data-region="status">{{statustext}}</span>
        <span class="starrating-stars">
            {{#stars}}
                {{#canrate}}
                    <span class="starrating-star {{#on}}starrating-on{{/on}}{{^on}}starrating-off{{/on}}"
                        data-value="{{value}}" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{label}}">
                        <i class="fa {{#on}}fa-star{{/on}}{{^on}}fa-star-o{{/on}}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    </span>
                {{/canrate}}
                {{^canrate}}
                    <span class="starrating-star {{#on}}starrating-on{{/on}}{{^on}}starrating-off{{/on}}">
                        <i class="fa {{#on}}fa-star{{/on}}{{^on}}fa-star-o{{/on}}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    </span>
                {{/canrate}}
            {{/stars}}
        </span>
        {{#showaverage}}
            <span class="starrating-average" data-region="average">{{averagetext}}</span>
        {{/showaverage}}
    </span>
    {{#feedbackform}}
        <span class="starrating-feedback" data-region="feedback">
            <label for="starrating-app-feedback-{{cmid}}" class="starrating-feedback-label">{{feedbacklabel}}</label>
            <textarea id="starrating-app-feedback-{{cmid}}" name="feedback" rows="3" maxlength="{{feedbackmaxlength}}"
                class="starrating-feedback-input">{{feedback}}</textarea>
            <button type="button" data-action="savefeedback"
                class="starrating-feedback-save{{^userrating}} starrating-hidden{{/userrating}}">{{savefeedbacklabel}}</button>
        </span>
    {{/feedbackform}}
</div>
